    "description": "TypeScript framework for building Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers. Declarative tool/resource/prompt definitions, pluggable auth, multi-backend storage, OpenTelemetry observability, and support for both local (stdio/HTTP) and edge (Cloudflare Workers)",
